## About Detect

Detect is about discovering anomalies and indicators of compromise in time. The function covers continuous monitoring, logging and analysis of events.

## Key areas

- Monitor networks, systems and user activity
- Collect and analyse logs
- Trigger alerts on anomalies
- Test that detection capability works
